{"id":"n3-079","title":"～について (〜ni tsuite)","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Expressing 'about', 'concerning', or 'regarding'.","longExplanation":"The ～について grammar point is used to express 'about', 'concerning', or 'regarding' a certain topic or subject. It is often used in both casual and formal contexts. The formation is simple – just add について after the noun that represents the topic you are discussing.","formation":"Noun + について","examples":[{"jp":"日本の文化について学びたいです。","romaji":"Nihon no bunka ni tsuite manabitai desu.","en":"I want to learn about Japanese culture.","words":[{"surface":"日本","vocabId":"1582710","reading":"にほん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"文化","vocabId":"1505120","reading":"ぶんか"},{"surface":"について","vocabId":null},{"surface":"学び","vocabId":"1640990","reading":"まなび","baseForm":"学ぶ"},{"surface":"たい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"彼の意見について話し合いましょう。","romaji":"Kare no iken ni tsuite hanashiaimashou.","en":"Let's discuss his opinion.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"意見","vocabId":"1156530","reading":"いけん"},{"surface":"について","vocabId":null},{"surface":"話し合い","vocabId":"1600910","reading":"はなしあい","baseForm":"話し合う"},{"surface":"ましょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"この問題について詳しく教えてください。","romaji":"Kono mondai ni tsuite kuwashiku oshiete kudasai.","en":"Please explain this issue in detail.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問題","vocabId":"1536010","reading":"もんだい"},{"surface":"について","vocabId":null},{"surface":"詳しく","vocabId":"1351730","reading":"くわしい","baseForm":"詳しい"},{"surface":"教え","vocabId":"1236890","reading":"おしえ","baseForm":"教える"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordI